  "Id": 3374,
  "Title": "Celebrating Excellence: AKU's 2024 Founder's Day Distinguished Leadership Awardees",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "At Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC), we applaud outstanding leadership that shapes our community and beyond.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC), we applaud outstanding leadership that shapes our community and beyond. This year, Dr. Charlotte Whiting and Dr. Philip Wood stand out for their remarkable contributions, earning AKU-ISMC's 2024 Founder's Day Distinguished Leadership Awards."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dr. Charlotte Whiting: Inspiring Academia and Advocacy"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "As Head of Operations, Communications & Development at AKU-ISMC, Dr. Charlotte Whiting's leadership has fuelled academic excellence and cultural understanding. She fosters dialogue and drives impactful research, enriching both AKU-ISMC and wider communities. Dr. Whiting's commitment to empowerment and social justice sets a shining example."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dr. Philip Wood: Exemplary Leadership"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dr. Philip Wood's leadership has been nothing short of transformative. With dedication and vision, he has navigated challenges and fostered growth within AKU-ISMC. As a respected professor, Dr. Wood's impact extends beyond academia, influencing and inspiring individuals across various sectors. His integrity, compassion, and commitment to excellence have not only elevated AKU-ISMC but have also set a benchmark for leadership globally."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Celebrating Achievement, Inspiring Others"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Let's celebrate Dr. Charlotte Whiting and Dr. Philip Wood for their exceptional leadership. Their dedication and vision inspire us to strive for excellence and make a positive impact in our communities. Congratulations to these deserving awardees on AKU-ISMC's Founder's Day!"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
